<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss 3-month money market claims set at 1.549 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss 3-month money market claims set at 1.549 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government set a rate of 1.549 percent per annum on its latest series 3.387 of Swiss money market claims.</p>
<p>The government allocated a total of 1,211.1 million Swiss francs in the offering, which was priced at a discount of 99.610 percent. The claims mature on August 21, 1997.</p>
<p>The previous series 3.386 yielded 1.581 percent.</p>
<p>The government also announced a new series 3.388 of three-month claims, maturing on August 28, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 258 7340</p>
